      "chunk_text": "Shaurya Joshi calls insurance agent Neha Kapoor to discuss either reinstating his old health policy or upgrading to a new one with dental and vision coverage. Neha offers a one-time 5% discount if Shaurya upgrades within 48 hours, though the new policy will still cost about 10% more than his old one. The call concludes with Neha asking Shaurya to make a decision between reinstating the old policy or taking the discounted new one.",
